  "description": "Chae Gyeong-jun, who gave up both college and his dreams due to the IMF crisis, once again faces despair in front of his grandmother’s sudden hospitalization fees. But then, a “Mysterious Benefactor” steps in to cover the hospital costs for his family… 'Who would provide support that doesn’t help them at all, and why?' In search of an answer, Gyeong-jun heads to Taeseong.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
